<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Stampede — Digital Loyalty Cards</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:opsz,wght@9..144,400;9..144,600;9..144,700&family=Work+Sans:wght@400;500;600&family=IBM+Plex+Mono:wght@500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #16241d;
      --ink-soft: #24352c;
      --card: #f1e9d8;
      --card-dim: #e4d9c1;
      --brass: #c9a24b;
      --brass-bright: #e0bc6a;
      --sage: #7c9c82;
      --line: rgba(241, 233, 216, 0.14);
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--card);
      font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.5;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }

    h1, h2, h3 {
      font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .wrap {
      max-width: 1140px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 0 32px;
    }

    /* ---------- NAV ---------- */
    header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 50;
      background: rgba(22, 36, 29, 0.88);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    nav.wrap {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      height: 76px;
    }

    .logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    }

    .logo .mark {
      width: 30px;
      height: 30px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1.5px dashed var(--brass);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--brass-bright);
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 36px;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      color: var(--card-dim);
    }

    .nav-links a { transition: color 0.15s ease; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--brass-bright); }

    .nav-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      font-family: 'Work Sans', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 10px 22px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.15s ease, opacity 0.15s ease;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
    }
    .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1px); }

    .btn-ghost {
      color: var(--card);
      border-color: var(--line);
    }
    .btn-ghost:hover { border-color: var(--brass); color: var(--brass-bright); }

    .btn-solid {
      background: var(--brass);
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .btn-solid:hover { background: var(--brass-bright); }

    .btn-lg { padding: 14px 30px; font-size: 1rem; }

    /* ---------- HERO ---------- */
    .hero {
      padding: 96px 0 100px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .hero-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.05fr 0.95fr;
      gap: 48px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--sage);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .eyebrow::before {
      content: "";
      width: 22px;
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--sage);
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 4.6vw, 3.6rem);
      line-height: 1.08;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }
    .hero h1 em {
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--brass-bright);
    }

    .hero p.lead {
      font-size: 1.08rem;
      color: var(--card-dim);
      max-width: 480px;
      margin-bottom: 34px;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 18px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .hero-note {
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--sage);
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    }

    /* signature: fanned stamp card stack */
    .stamp-scene {
      position: relative;
      height: 420px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .stamp-card {
      position: absolute;
      width: 300px;
      height: 190px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: var(--ink-soft);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      box-shadow: 0 30px 60px -20px rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
      padding: 22px;
    }

    .stamp-card.back {
      transform: rotate(-11deg) translate(-70px, 10px);
      opacity: 0.55;
    }
    .stamp-card.mid {
      transform: rotate(6deg) translate(60px, -8px);
      opacity: 0.8;
    }
    .stamp-card.front {
      background: var(--card);
      color: var(--ink);
      transform: rotate(-2deg);
      z-index: 3;
    }

    .card-top {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }
    .card-brand {
      font-family: 'Fraunces', serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }
    .card-tier {
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      background: var(--ink);
      color: var(--brass-bright);
      padding: 4px 9px;
      border-radius: 999px;
    }

    .punches {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .punch {
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 1.5px dashed rgba(22,36,29,0.35);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }
    .punch.filled {
      border-style: solid;
      border-color: var(--brass);
      background: var(--brass);
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
    }

    /* ---------- HOW IT WORKS ---------- */
    .section {
      padding: 90px 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .section-head {
      max-width: 560px;
      margin-bottom: 56px;
    }

    .section-head h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .section-head p {
      color: var(--card-dim);
      font-size: 1.02rem;
    }

    .steps {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .step {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 30px 26px;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(241,233,216,0.03), transparent);
    }

    .step .num {
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      color: var(--brass);
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      display: block;
    }

    .step h3 {
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .step p {
      color: var(--card-dim);
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }

    /* ---------- FEATURES ---------- */
    .features {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 1px;
      background: var(--line);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .feature {
      background: var(--ink);
      padding: 32px 28px;
    }

    .feature h3 {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: var(--brass-bright);
    }

    .feature p {
      color: var(--card-dim);
      font-size: 0.92rem;
    }

    /* ---------- CTA BAND ---------- */
    .cta-band {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 80px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .cta-band h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.4vw, 2.6rem);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .cta-band p {
      color: var(--card-dim);
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    /* ---------- FOOTER ---------- */
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 56px 0 32px;
    }

    .footer-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 44px;
    }

    .footer-brand p {
      color: var(--card-dim);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-top: 14px;
      max-width: 260px;
    }

    .footer-col h4 {
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--sage);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .footer-col a {
      display: block;
      color: var(--card-dim);
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      transition: color 0.15s ease;
    }
    .footer-col a:hover { color: var(--brass-bright); }

    .footer-bottom {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding-top: 24px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--card-dim);
    }

    /* ---------- RESPONSIVE ---------- */
    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .nav-links { display: none; }
      .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .stamp-scene { height: 300px; margin-top: 20px; }
      .stamp-card { width: 250px; height: 160px; }
      .steps, .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .wrap { padding: 0 20px; }
      .footer-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .footer-bottom { flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; align-items: flex-start; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      * { transition: none !important; }
    }

    a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--brass-bright);
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <nav class="wrap">
      <a href="/" class="logo">
        <span class="mark">St</span>
        Stampede
      </a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
        <a href="#features">Features</a>
        <a href="#for-business">For businesses</a>
        <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
      </div>
      <div class="nav-actions">
        <a href="/login" class="btn btn-ghost">Log in</a>
        <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-solid">Sign up</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <!-- ---------- HERO ---------- -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="wrap hero-grid">
        <div>
          <div class="eyebrow">Digital loyalty, no plastic</div>
          <h1>Every stamp your customers earn, <em>saved to their phone.</em></h1>
          <p class="lead">
            Stampede turns your punch cards into a digital wallet pass. Customers collect stamps with a tap, you get real data on who's coming back — no app download required.
          </p>
          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-solid btn-lg">Get started free</a>
            <a href="#how-it-works" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">See how it works</a>
          </div>
          <div class="hero-note">✓ Free for your first 100 customers</div>
        </div>

        <div class="stamp-scene">
          <div class="stamp-card back"></div>
          <div class="stamp-card mid"></div>
          <div class="stamp-card front">
            <div class="card-top">
              <div class="card-brand">Cedar &amp; Co.</div>
              <div class="card-tier">Gold tier</div>
            </div>
            <div class="punches">
              <div class="punch filled">✓</div>
              <div class="punch filled">✓</div>
              <div class="punch filled">✓</div>
              <div class="punch filled">✓</div>
              <div class="punch filled">✓</div>
              <div class="punch"></div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ---------- HOW IT WORKS ---------- -->
    <section class="section" id="how-it-works">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>Three taps and they're a regular</h2>
          <p>No hardware, no plastic cards to reprint, no app for your customers to download.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="steps">
          <div class="step">
            <span class="num">01</span>
            <h3>Customer scans a QR</h3>
            <p>At checkout, they scan a code and the card lands straight in Apple Wallet or Google Wallet.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <span class="num">02</span>
            <h3>You add a stamp</h3>
            <p>One tap from your dashboard or POS adds a stamp and updates their pass instantly, wherever they are.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="step">
            <span class="num">03</span>
            <h3>Reward unlocks itself</h3>
            <p>When the card fills up, the customer gets a push notification — no code to remember, no card to lose.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ---------- FEATURES ---------- -->
    <section class="section" id="features">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-head">
          <h2>Built for the counter, not the boardroom</h2>
          <p>Everything you need to run a loyalty program, nothing you have to configure for a week first.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="features">
          <div class="feature">
            <h3>Wallet-native cards</h3>
            <p>Lives in Apple Wallet and Google Wallet. Updates in real time, even offline.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <h3>Customer insights</h3>
            <p>See who's close to a reward, who's gone quiet, and who your regulars actually are.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <h3>Push reminders</h3>
            <p>Nudge lapsed customers back in with a location-aware notification, not a spammy email.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <h3>Any device at the counter</h3>
            <p>Add a stamp from a phone, tablet, or your existing POS — no dedicated scanner needed.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <h3>Custom rewards</h3>
            <p>Punch cards, points, or tiers — set the rules that fit how your business actually runs.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <h3>Multi-location ready</h3>
            <p>One loyalty program across every branch, with per-location reporting when you need it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ---------- CTA BAND ---------- -->
    <section class="cta-band">
      <div class="wrap">
        <h2>Ready to stop printing punch cards?</h2>
        <p>Set up your first digital loyalty card in under ten minutes.</p>
        <a href="/signup" class="btn btn-solid btn-lg">Create your free account</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="footer-grid">
        <div class="footer-brand">
          <a href="/" class="logo">
            <span class="mark">St</span>
            Stampede
          </a>
          <p>Digital loyalty cards for shops that would rather earn a regular than run a discount.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-col">
          <h4>Product</h4>
          <a href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
          <a href="#features">Features</a>
          <a href="#pricing">Pricing</a>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-col">
          <h4>Company</h4>
          <a href="#for-business">For businesses</a>
          <a href="/about">About</a>
          <a href="/contact">Contact</a>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-col">
          <h4>Account</h4>
          <a href="/login">Log in</a>
          <a href="/signup">Sign up</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-bottom">
        <span>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Stampede. All rights reserved.</span>
        <span>Made for shop counters, not spreadsheets.</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
